g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3e/o5ovwooscja287j6rl1axk39mbjxp7x.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E8%BD%B0%E9%9A%86%E9%9A%86%EF%BC%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3e/o5ovwooscja287j6rl1axk39mbjxp7x.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />轰隆隆！\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灼烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">灼烧</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"点燃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">点燃</font></span></span>]的角色，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，可同时生效。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灼烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">灼烧</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"点燃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">点燃</font></span></span>]的角色，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，可同时生效。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"希望之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/40px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/60px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/80px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：80<img alt=\"希望之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/40px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/60px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/80px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：180<img alt=\"希望之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/40px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/60px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/kq40wrxv8xclezkb34moo3400yy7dha.png/80px-%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\">可习得该极限解放的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B4%9D%E6%8B%89\" title=\"角色图鉴库/贝拉\"><img alt=\"头像 贝拉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f8/8bxs90gczly5mm33ztadzac8vaqhyoa.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-heigh